WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.667 --> 00:00:02.968
-Welcome, welcome, welcome to
"The Tonight Show," everybody.

00:00:02.968 --> 00:00:04.234
You're here.
You made it.

00:00:04.234 --> 00:00:05.534
Thank you for watching.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:05.534 --> 00:00:07.200
Thank you for tuning in.

00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:08.267
Well, guys, it seems like

00:00:08.267 --> 00:00:09.634
there's so much
going on right now.

00:00:09.634 --> 00:00:12.300
The NFL Draft kicked off tonight
in Las Vegas.

00:00:12.300 --> 00:00:13.467
That's right.

00:00:13.467 --> 00:00:17.634
Elon Musk is buying Twitter
for $44 billion.

00:00:17.634 --> 00:00:20.400
We got our first look
at the sequel to "Avatar."

00:00:20.400 --> 00:00:23.767
And Chipotle says that they want
to start offering dessert.

00:00:23.767 --> 00:00:24.934
There's a lot to go over.

00:00:24.934 --> 00:00:28.267
[ Laughter ]

00:00:28.267 --> 00:00:30.567
So let's just jump in
and cover it all at once.

00:00:30.567 --> 00:00:32.434
It's time for a "News Smash."
Here we go.

00:00:32.434 --> 00:00:33.767
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:33.767 --> 00:00:37.868
♪♪

00:00:37.868 --> 00:00:41.167
First up, the NFL Draft got
under way tonight in Las Vegas.

00:00:41.167 --> 00:00:42.601
The best
college football players

00:00:42.601 --> 00:00:44.367
are heading to the pros,
where they're going to make

00:00:44.367 --> 00:00:46.701
a lot of money,
almost enough money to...

00:00:46.701 --> 00:00:47.868
buy Twitter.

00:00:47.868 --> 00:00:49.434
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.434 --> 00:00:53.334
Elon Musk is buying
the company for $44 billion.

00:00:53.334 --> 00:00:55.968
The whole thing came together
really fast, unlike...

00:00:55.968 --> 00:00:57.200
"Avatar 2."

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:00.601
It's been
13 years in the making.

00:01:00.601 --> 00:01:03.000
And they're calling it
"The Way of Water,"

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:05.934
which is also what you hear from
the bathroom after eating...

00:01:05.934 --> 00:01:07.567
Chipotle dessert.

00:01:07.567 --> 00:01:10.667
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:10.667 --> 00:01:13.200
Word of warning --
don't stand behind anyone

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:15.067
who eats it
or you might feel a...

00:01:15.067 --> 00:01:16.634
draft.

00:01:16.634 --> 00:01:19.067
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:19.067 --> 00:01:21.567
Hey, Tom Brady wasn't picked
until the sixth round.

00:01:21.567 --> 00:01:24.267
He waited longer to get drafted
than we've waited for...

00:01:24.267 --> 00:01:27.000
"Avatar 2."

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:29.434
Those "Avatar" characters have
some unusual names,

00:01:29.434 --> 00:01:33.033
like Neytiri, Mo'at, and...

00:01:33.033 --> 00:01:35.968
Elon Musk.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.968 --> 00:01:37.734
He's taking
a big risk with Twitter,

00:01:37.734 --> 00:01:40.033
and he might regret it,
kind of like eating...

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:42.067
Chipotle dessert.

00:01:42.067 --> 00:01:44.734
If it's anything like the guac,
it'll cost...

00:01:44.734 --> 00:01:48.434
$44 billion.

00:01:48.434 --> 00:01:50.100
So, in conclusion...

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:52.100
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:53.734 --> 00:01:55.267
So, in conclusion...

00:01:55.267 --> 00:01:57.234
welcome to the NFL...

00:01:57.234 --> 00:01:59.334
welcome to a living hell...

00:01:59.334 --> 00:02:01.868
finally here, what a shocker...

00:02:01.868 --> 00:02:03.834
think ahead, call a doctor.

00:02:03.834 --> 00:02:06.100
This has been a "News Smash."

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:07.601
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:07.601 --> 00:02:12.868
♪♪

00:02:12.868 --> 00:02:15.100
Hey, get this --
new satellite images

00:02:15.100 --> 00:02:18.334
were just released that show
Russia is using trained dolphins

00:02:18.334 --> 00:02:22.133
to protect a key naval base
in the Black Sea.

00:02:22.133 --> 00:02:23.667
You can tell things
are a little off

00:02:23.667 --> 00:02:24.901
when the leader of your country
is like,

00:02:24.901 --> 00:02:26.868
"All right, enough's enough.
Send in Flipper."

00:02:26.868 --> 00:02:30.367
All right.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:30.367 --> 00:02:31.667
I'm wondering, is it possible

00:02:31.667 --> 00:02:34.100
Russia thinks our Navy SEALs
are actual seals?

00:02:34.100 --> 00:02:38.667
[ Laughter ]

00:02:38.667 --> 00:02:40.767
Yeah, defense dolphins
are a good tactic

00:02:40.767 --> 00:02:42.901
if your enemy hates
adorable wet kisses.

00:02:42.901 --> 00:02:45.400
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.400 --> 00:02:47.734
Some more strange news.
Canada is trying

00:02:47.734 --> 00:02:50.634
to change its laws so that
it can prosecute Canadians

00:02:50.634 --> 00:02:53.367
if they commit crimes
on the Moon.

00:02:53.367 --> 00:02:54.968
[ Laughter ]

00:02:54.968 --> 00:02:57.200
Even the Space Force is like,
"I know we're not the ones

00:02:57.200 --> 00:03:01.200
to talk, but do we need this?"
[ Laughter ]

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:03.033
Hey, listen to this --
yesterday, Pope Francis

00:03:03.033 --> 00:03:06.400
told married people to be kind
to their mothers-in-laws

00:03:06.400 --> 00:03:10.300
because there are so many
clichés that make fun of them.

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:12.567
Everyone heard and was like,
"Yeah, easy for him to say."

00:03:12.567 --> 00:03:16.701
[ Laughter ]

00:03:16.701 --> 00:03:18.133
Even the Vatican choir was like,

00:03:18.133 --> 00:03:19.868
"You ain't preaching to us
on this one."

00:03:19.868 --> 00:03:21.067
[ Laughter ]

00:03:21.067 --> 00:03:23.334
Yep, the Pope's had it
with mother-in-law jokes.

00:03:23.334 --> 00:03:25.567
Then he was like, "Also,
ease up on Spirit Airlines.

00:03:25.567 --> 00:03:26.934
It sucks, we get it.
All right, come on."

00:03:26.934 --> 00:03:29.467
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:29.467 --> 00:03:31.434
As I said earlier,
the title of the long-awaited

00:03:31.434 --> 00:03:33.467
"Avatar" sequel
was released yesterday.

00:03:33.467 --> 00:03:36.400
It is called
"Avatar: The Way of Water."

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:39.133
Well, that wasn't the only name
they considered.

00:03:39.133 --> 00:03:41.000
Here's some other ones
that they almost went with.

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:43.801
First there's "Avatar 2:
Ever Wonder What It'd Look Like

00:03:43.801 --> 00:03:45.367
if the Smurfs
Went to Burning Man?"

00:03:45.367 --> 00:03:50.400
[ Laughter ]

00:03:50.400 --> 00:03:53.367
Next, there's "Avatar 2:
This one's Just Two Hours

00:03:53.367 --> 00:03:56.167
of a Blue Guy Connecting
his Ponytail to a Bird."

00:03:56.167 --> 00:03:59.200
[ Laughter ]

00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:01.300
And finally, "Avatar 2:
The First Movie

00:04:01.300 --> 00:04:03.634
is Almost Old Enough
to Buy Cigarettes Now."

00:04:03.634 --> 00:04:05.033
[ Laughter and applause ]
That's --

00:04:05.033 --> 00:04:07.601
They were thinking --
I like the one they went with.

00:04:07.601 --> 00:04:09.834
[ Applause ]

00:04:09.834 --> 00:04:12.834
Hey, guys, I read that
some "elite" Yelp reviewers,

00:04:12.834 --> 00:04:15.701
who are trusted on the site,
have been getting paid

00:04:15.701 --> 00:04:18.701
to write good reviews
for restaurants.

00:04:18.701 --> 00:04:21.033
Wow.
If I can't trust Bob S.,

00:04:21.033 --> 00:04:23.634
who went to a Denny's in
Illinois once, who can I trust?

00:04:23.634 --> 00:04:25.200
[ Laughter ]

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:27.067
That's right.
Yelp knew something was wrong

00:04:27.067 --> 00:04:30.067
when a user described Arby's
meatloaf as "tantalizing."

00:04:30.067 --> 00:04:33.601
[ Laughter ]

00:04:33.601 --> 00:04:35.300
"Tantalizing."

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:37.467
Well, as I mentioned,
Chipotle recently said that it's

00:04:37.467 --> 00:04:41.234
continuing to work hard
to add dessert to its menu.

00:04:41.234 --> 00:04:42.667
Yeah,
that's what Chipotle needs --

00:04:42.667 --> 00:04:45.267
more decisions for the person
in line ahead of you, yeah.

00:04:45.267 --> 00:04:48.767
"Do I want to try sprinkles?
I don't know.

00:04:48.767 --> 00:04:50.601
Can I try a sample
of the Rocky Road?

00:04:50.601 --> 00:04:53.067
I just never --"
[ Laughter ]

00:04:53.067 --> 00:04:54.534
"What does vanilla taste like?"

00:04:54.534 --> 00:04:59.934
[ Laughter ]

00:04:59.934 --> 00:05:01.868
"You don't know what vanilla --"
"No."

00:05:01.868 --> 00:05:03.267
"Well, then you shouldn't
get ice cream.

00:05:03.267 --> 00:05:05.467
Maybe go home, think about it."

00:05:05.467 --> 00:05:07.400
This is fun.
Apparently, they're building,

00:05:07.400 --> 00:05:08.801
right here in our building,
they're building

00:05:08.801 --> 00:05:11.734
a "skylift" observation platform
at the top of the Rock

00:05:11.734 --> 00:05:13.000
here at Rockefeller Center.

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:14.601
Take a look at this thing.

00:05:14.601 --> 00:05:16.934
Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:16.934 --> 00:05:18.801
The city like you've never
seen it before,

00:05:18.801 --> 00:05:21.200
from exactly 20 feet higher up.
Amazing.

00:05:21.200 --> 00:05:24.701
[ Laughter ]

00:05:24.701 --> 00:05:26.400
Can -- Can we see it again?

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:27.601
Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:27.601 --> 00:05:29.934
Looks like the onion volcano
at Benihana.

00:05:29.934 --> 00:05:33.434
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:33.434 --> 00:05:37.567
Why?
Why?

00:05:37.567 --> 00:05:39.734
Oh, guys, get this -- I heard
about a woman in the U.K.

00:05:39.734 --> 00:05:43.300
who went to some pretty extreme
lengths to live with her cat.

00:05:43.300 --> 00:05:44.534
Check this out.

00:05:44.534 --> 00:05:46.834
-A London woman
was tired of her landlord

00:05:46.834 --> 00:05:49.100
telling her that she couldn't
have pets in the building.

00:05:49.100 --> 00:05:51.300
So you know what she did?
She married her cat.

00:05:51.300 --> 00:05:55.100
She says the marriage between
her and 5-year-old India

00:05:55.100 --> 00:05:59.801
is to let future landlords know
the two are a package deal.

00:05:59.801 --> 00:06:03.033
[ Laughter ]

00:06:03.033 --> 00:06:06.200
-Meanwhile, the landlord
was thinking, "You win?"

00:06:06.200 --> 00:06:11.300
[ Laughter ]

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:12.734
Yeah, I'm not sure
the cat is on board.

00:06:12.734 --> 00:06:14.534
Can we see the cat again?

00:06:14.534 --> 00:06:16.567
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:06:16.567 --> 00:06:18.567
[ Rimshot ]

00:06:18.567 --> 00:06:24.667
[ Laughter and applause
continues ]

00:06:24.667 --> 00:06:26.634
That cat is saying, "What have
I done with my nine lives?

00:06:26.634 --> 00:06:28.467
Oh, my gosh."

